// shader-differential — control shader A.
//
// Solid color for the two standing controls:
//   control-identical: this shader's container, byte-copied twice by
//     the stager, must judge IDENTICAL — proves the pair path, the
//     transfer, and the comparator agree that same input means same
//     output.
//   control-mismatch:  this shader vs sd_ctrl_b must judge MISMATCH —
//     proves the comparator can SEE a difference before any real pair
//     is trusted.  A rig whose deliberate mismatch passes is judging
//     nothing.
//
// The color is chosen away from the rig's two sentinels (opaque black
// readback fill, 0xFF102030 GPU clear) so every control pixel is
// distinguishable from "no draw landed".

void main(out float4 out_color : COLOR)
{
    out_color = float4(0.25f, 0.5f, 0.75f, 1.0f);
}
